# Renders the four structure panels of the thesis design-region figure.
#
# Panel A is the input complex, receptor cornflower blue, effector light green,
# both design regions coloured. Panel B is three designs at design region 1
# lengths of 10, 15 and 20, receptor only, superimposed on the fixed
# N-terminal block and drawn at one camera so the rebuilt length compares
# between them. A and B use different cameras: A frames the complex, B frames
# the domain face-on.
#
# Paths are relative, so run from this directory. ChimeraX cannot save
# images under --nogui on macOS, where it has no OpenGL context, so this
# needs the GUI:
#   cd analyses/01-design-region-backbones
#   ChimeraX render_design_regions.cxc
# The rendered PNGs are kept in renders/ so the figure can be rebuilt
# without re-rendering.
#
# Design region 1 starts at residue 33 in every design and runs for its
# observed length. Design region 2 is the final 6 residues.

open ../../inputs/pikp1_avrpikf_complex_ab.pdb
open ../../runs/crystal_full_test_contig/results/rfdiffusion/design_18.pdb
open ../../runs/crystal_full_test_contig/results/rfdiffusion/design_40.pdb
open ../../runs/crystal_full_test_contig/results/rfdiffusion/design_48.pdb
rename #1 input
rename #2 d18
rename #3 d40
rename #4 d48
dssp
hide atoms
show cartoon
color cornflower blue
color /B light green
color #1/A:33-45 red
color #1/A:73-78 purple
color #2/A:33-42 red
color #2/A:70-75 purple
color #3/A:33-47 red
color #3/A:75-80 purple
color #4/A:33-52 red
color #4/A:80-85 purple
align #2/A:1-32@CA toAtoms #4/A:1-32@CA
align #3/A:1-32@CA toAtoms #4/A:1-32@CA
set bgColor white
lighting flat
graphics silhouettes true width 1.5
hide #2,3,4 models
view orient
turn x 225
turn y 345
turn z 45
view #1
save renders/input.png width 2600 supersample 2 transparentBackground true
hide #1 models
hide /B cartoon
show #4 models
view orient
turn x 255
turn z 50
view #4
zoom 0.97
save renders/design_48_len20.png width 3000 supersample 2 transparentBackground true
hide #4 models
show #2 models
save renders/design_18_len10.png width 3000 supersample 2 transparentBackground true
hide #2 models
show #3 models
save renders/design_40_len15.png width 3000 supersample 2 transparentBackground true
exit
